  "description": "TypeScript-style utility types (Pick, Omit, Partial, Map) for C# via Roslyn incremental source generator. Zero runtime overhead — members are generated at compile time. No reflection, no runtime dependencies.\n\n• [Pick]    copy only the named members from a source type\n• [Omit]    copy everything except the named members\n• [Partial] make all (or selected) members nullable\n• [Map]     copy all members that pass the filter\n\nSupports MemberTypeTransform (Nullable / NonNullable / Required), FromTypes interface contracts, [MapIgnore] for hand-written members, and SourceSignature change detection.",
  "id": "UtilityTypes",
  "isPrerelease": false,
